+ *   Platform      GET/PATCH/DELETE /v1/platform/tenants(+ /:id/staff) ·
+ *                 /v1/platform/overview · staff · billing · webhooks ·
+ *                 audit-logs · ai/(providers|tasks|costs)
+ *   Public        GET  /v1/public/forms/:slug · POST .../submissions
