+## 2. CSS Variables — Light & Dark Mode
+
+### 2.1 `globals.css` — root theme tokens
+
+```css
+@tailwind base;
+@tailwind components;
+@tailwind utilities;
+
+@layer base {
+  :root {
+    /* ── Neutrals (Light Mode) ──────────────────────── */
